  "user_request_original": "Simulate and optimize a 36-layer alternating Ta2O5/SiO2 dielectric filter on fused silica substrate at 0 degree incidence with unpolarized illumination. Layer sequence: Air | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Ta2O5 | SiO2 | Fused Silica (36 finite layers total, starting with Ta2O5). Each layer thickness bounded 20-350 nm. Initialize from the iteration 02 best candidate thicknesses: [107.14966239852325, 137.99394304715145, 106.1396480229194, 105.43423519442798, 108.38062555215072, 153.38398125209014, 104.20578857329681, 172.77431696012712, 113.15574014639562, 153.98273791778706, 101.5830859896286, 141.79930612672644, 95.67768877875027, 134.33253100901547, 98.27050633991132, 125.78268591037838, 96.4720055073605, 132.10535910279305, 93.8107947096124, 134.212145996059, 96.77431577286404, 127.72598083457547, 94.98807187250448, 132.9856261855332, 91.53349941862439, 133.89897224226587, 97.03284735250075, 133.18762006420167, 94.86093418991078, 143.77354638084745, 85.01210429550451, 146.01264934304848, 98.90937221687832, 146.31368244854312, 108.95437475502086, 41.105935114302895]. Apply gradient-based thickness optimization with maximum step-size constraint of ±20 nm per layer per optimization round. Implement Pareto-retention: automatically preserve any candidate achieving target_score ≥0.925 across all generations. Spectral grid: 300-1200 nm with 1 nm resolution. Compute transmittance for unpolarized light at 0 degrees. Objective: maximize weighted combination of (average transmittance in 420-700 nm) minus (average transmittance in 355-365 nm) minus (average transmittance in 1030-1080 nm) minus (transmittance at 355 nm). Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and final thicknesses_nm for all candidates. Canonical user controls: incidence angles 0 degrees. polarization unpolarized. wavelength intervals 355-355 nm, 355-365 nm, 420-700 nm, 1030-1080 nm. soft objectives: high average transmittance in 420-700 nm; low average transmittance at 355 nm; low average transmittance in 355-365 nm; low average transmittance in 1030-1080 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high transmittance at 355 nm; high transmittance in 355-365 nm; high transmittance in 1030-1080 nm; high loss in 420-700 nm. manufacturing constraints: maximum 36 layers; layer thickness range 20-350 nm.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize 36 alternating Ta2O5/SiO2 layers on fused silica substrate (20–350 nm bounds) using provided initial thicknesses. Maximize mean transmittance in 420–700 nm while minimizing mean transmittance in 355–365 nm, 1030–1080 nm, and at 355 nm under unpolarized normal incidence from 300 to 1200 nm.",
